<p><img src="https://cdn.blot.im/blog_177bc256f0ee469c998e912e20ece048/_image_cache/00f93e36-5728-4542-86ab-8ff38c6def5c/pasted-percent20image-percent2020260706093356.png" alt="Photo of handwriting in a small notebook. The topic is morning pages, and the writing is curly and rather difficult to read. Full transcript at the end of this post." width="2166" height="1508"></p>
<p>This week:</p>
<ul>
<li>Putting money on the table to develop a daily writing habit<br>
</li>
<li>Text based visuals and the vision impaired</li>
